WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Perplexity cited our dog food
benchmark in all three answers.

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.580
Including its number-one pick.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.560
We asked four assistants the
same shopper’s question three ways.

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.780
Purina Pro Plan appeared
in all twelve answers.

5
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.180
ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity
each ranked it first.

6
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.680
Claude preferred it for this shopper
without giving a numbered ranking.

7
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.520
In Perplexity’s ranking,
the citation beside

8
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.980
Purina Pro Plan pointed
back to RecoScope.

9
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.100
That shows which source it cited.

10
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.520
These answers don’t establish
what caused the ranking

11
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.890
or which product is better.

12
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.540
Try this for your brand.

13
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.290
Ask for a recommendation,
add a budget,

14
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.990
then ask for a ranked list.

15
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.700
Record who gets mentioned,

16
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.340
who gets ranked,
and which pages get cited.

17
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.460
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
